{"unit_id":"tag:0A5F:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在基本（Fundamental）群（Groups）第<REF_0001>节中，已在某种意义上看到：取<MATH_0001>与基变换（base change）交换（commutes），若<MATH_0002>为固有态射（proper morphism），且<MATH_0003>为有限群（finite group）（不一定交换（commutative））。本节从这些结果推出一个有用的推论。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Fundamental","target_term":"基本"},{"source_term":"Groups","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"固有态射"},{"source_term":"finite group","target_term":"有限群"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Fundamental","target_term":"基本","context":"章节名；词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"Groups","target_term":"群","context":"章节名；词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"固有态射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"finite group","target_term":"有限群","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换","context":"词表尚未批准"}],"notes":[]}
