{"unit_id":"tag:0A5G:proof","translation":"由景上上同调（Cohomology on Sites）引理<REF_0001>，<MATH_0001>中的元素（element）对应于<MATH_0002>-挠子（torsor）<MATH_0003>，它在<MATH_0004>上。这样的挠子（torsor）显然为有限（finite）局部常值（locally constant）层（sheaf）。故<MATH_0005>可表（representable）为概形（scheme）<MATH_0006>，它有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）于<MATH_0007>之上，由引理<REF_0002>得到。反之，概形（scheme）<MATH_0008>有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）于<MATH_0009>之上，具有<MATH_0010>-作用（action），使之成为<MATH_0011>-挠子（torsor），它在<MATH_0012>上，从而产生上同调（cohomology）类（class）。同样的对应在<MATH_0013>上的上同调（cohomology）类（classes）与有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）于<MATH_0014>之上的挠子（torsors）之间成立。因此此引理为基本（Fundamental）群（Groups）引理<REF_0003>的范畴等价（equivalence of categories）的推论。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上上同调"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"torsor","target_term":"挠子"},{"source_term":"torsor","target_term":"挠子"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"action","target_term":"作用"},{"source_term":"torsor","target_term":"挠子"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"classes","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"torsors","target_term":"挠子"},{"source_term":"Fundamental","target_term":"基本"},{"source_term":"Groups","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_te