{"unit_id":"tag:0A5F:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面的技术引理是固有基变换定理（proper base change theorem）证明中的关键要素。此论证逐字适用于任意固有（proper）概形（scheme），它在<MATH_0001>上，其特殊纤维（special fibre）的维数（dimension）为<MATH_0002>；但事实上，结论将是固有基变换定理（proper base change theorem）的推论，我们仅在其证明中需要此特定版本。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"proper base change theorem","target_term":"固有基变换定理"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"special fibre","target_term":"特殊纤维"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"proper base change theorem","target_term":"固有基变换定理"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"proper base change theorem","target_term":"固有基变换定理","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"special fibre","target_term":"特殊纤维","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数","context":"词表尚未批准"}],"notes":[]}
